        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>古诗六首</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 14px;\n    background: #f7c98a;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    background: #f7c98a;\n    gap: 6px;\n    border: 6px solid #f7c98a;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 14px 10px 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 4px 0 2px;\n  }\n  .author {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin: 0 8px 10px 0;\n  }\n  .poem {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《登鹳雀楼》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-王之涣)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      白日依山尽,<br>\n      黄河入海流。<br>\n      欲穷千里目,<br>\n      更上一层楼。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《静夜思》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-李白)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      床前明月光,<br>\n      疑是地上霜。<br>\n      举头望明月,<br>\n      低头思故乡。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《古朗月行》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-李白)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      小时不识月,<br>\n      呼作白玉盘。<br>\n      又疑瑶台镜,<br>\n      飞在青云端。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《寻隐者不遇》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-贾岛)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      松下问童子,<br>\n      言师采药去。<br>\n      只在此山中,<br>\n      云深不知处。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《咏鹅》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-骆宾王)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      鹅鹅鹅,<br>\n      曲项向天歌。<br>\n      白毛浮绿水,<br>\n      红掌拨清波。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cell\">\n    <div class=\"title\">《草》</div>\n    <div class=\"author\">(唐-白居易)</div>\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n      离离原上草,<br>\n      一岁一枯荣。<br>\n      野火烧不尽,<br>\n      春风吹又生。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
